ENABLE
CONF T
HOSTNAME HQ-Edge-RTR
NO ENABLE PASSWORD
ENABLE SECRET CISCO

INT G0/0
DESCRIPTION LINK_TRANSITO_L3_CORE_3650
IP ADDRESS 172.16.16.2 255.255.255.252
NO SHUT
EXIT

INT S0/3/0
DESCRIPTION WAN1_BRANCH_RJ
IP ADDRESS 10.0.0.1 255.255.255.252
CLOCK RATE 64000
NO SHUT
EXIT

INT S0/3/1
DESCRIPTION WAN3_CPD_DATACENTER
IP ADDRESS 10.0.0.10 255.255.255.252
NO SHUT
EXIT

ROUTER OSPF 1
ROUTER-ID 2.2.2.2
NETWORK 172.16.16.0 0.0.0.3 AREA 0
NETWORK 10.0.0.0 0.0.0.3 AREA 0
